From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Norman Herms <dockseed@proton.me>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 20:33:32 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] ASoC: dt-bindings: sun4i-i2s: Add the Allwinner A733

The five I2S/PCM controllers of the A733 have the register layout of
the R329 one. Add a compatible with the R329 as fallback.

Tested on Radxa Cubie A7S: booted on two boards with the I2S nodes
enabled in a test overlay; all five bind sun4i-i2s through this
compatible and loop 48 kHz and 44.1 kHz data back through their internal
loop. No codec or header pin is used.

Assisted-by: LLM
---
 .../devicetree/bindings/sound/allwinner,sun4i-a10-i2s.yaml       | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/allwinner,sun4i-a10-i2s.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/allwinner,sun4i-a10-i2s.yaml
index ae86cb5f0a74..2391d1cb8f9c 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/allwinner,sun4i-a10-i2s.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/sound/allwinner,sun4i-a10-i2s.yaml
@@ -36,6 +36,7 @@ properties:
           - enum:
               - allwinner,sun20i-d1-i2s
               - allwinner,sun55i-a523-i2s
+              - allwinner,sun60i-a733-i2s
           - const: allwinner,sun50i-r329-i2s
 
   reg:
